# caffeine/def2-TZVP B3LYP (VWN-RPA = B3LYP/G, as PySCF's B3LYP), gas phase, ORCA 6.1.1's default RIJCOSX (def2/J,
# GRIDX1/2 in the SCF and the final exchange energy on GRIDX3), TightSCF, the default grid (DefGrid2).
! B3LYP/G def2-TZVP TightSCF
%pal nprocs 6 end
%maxcore 1800
* xyzfile 0 1 caffeine.xyz
